Package: qepm
Title: QEPM Multi-Agent Quant Research System
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dohoon", "Kim", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dohoon@example.com")
Description: Multi-agent system for quantitative equity portfolio management.
    Implements the QEPM Lawbook v1.4.2 with memory distillation pipeline,
    orchestration engine, and specialized agents for research, validation,
    and portfolio management.
